    "objective": "Operators report the plant is behaving abnormally, but no specific cause or location has been identified. Investigate across the process -- discover what equipment and measurements exist, check for deviations, and determine which equipment is actually affected and why.\n",
    "conclusion": "The plant is experiencing an abnormality in the Stripper equipment. Specifically, the concentration of component G in the stripper underflow (urn:icab:measurement:stripper_underflow_g_concentration) has increased from approximately 53-54 mol % (observed between 01:00 and 02:45) to approximately 55-56 mol % starting around 03:00, reaching 55.90 mol % at 05:00. Simultaneously, the concentration of component H in the stripper underflow (urn:icab:measurement:stripper_underflow_h_concentration) has decreased from approximately 43-44 mol % to approximately 41-42 mol % during the same period. Other checked measurements, including reactor temperature (stable at ~120.4 degC), separator temperature (~76.1 degC), and stripper temperature (~60.9 degC), show no significant deviations.",
